---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Promise Newark">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Starting in Newark, NJ. Growing across the USA.</p>
    <h1>The greatest of all time, measured in kids who graduate.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      LeBron James's greatest legacy isn't a ring. It's a public school in Akron that gives kids who
      were falling behind a real path to college. This site holds the planning materials for bringing
      that model to Newark first, and then helping it grow city by city.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button" href="/committee/">Meet the planning committee</a>
      <a class="button alt" href="/documents/">Read the planning drafts</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="workstreams">
    <h2>What we're working on</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong><a href="/committee/">Planning committee.</a></strong> Nine seats, led organizationally by Nicole Newman.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/plan/">Foundation and steering plan.</a></strong> Mission, school model, the Promise Pathway and the roadmap to July 2027.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/pitch/">Foundation one-pager.</a></strong> The ask to the LeBron James Family Foundation.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/budget/">Philanthropy budget.</a></strong> What it costs to launch in fall 2028 and sustain for five years.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/expansion/">Future expansion.</a></strong> Newark first, then 21 more sites across 19 states in three waves.</li>
      <li><strong>Site search.</strong> Finding a building in Newark.</li>
      <li><strong>Lessons learned.</strong> What worked and what didn't in Akron.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/brand/">Marketing materials.</a></strong> The We Promise logo set, then a pitch deck.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 24px 0 40px; max-width: 760px; }
  .eyebrow { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--brick); }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); margin: 8px 0 16px; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .button {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--navy); color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .button.alt { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); }
  .workstreams ul { padding-left: 20px; }
  .workstreams li { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
